{"name":"Catalan","hex":"#429395","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Catalan","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A native or inhabitant of Catalonia"]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["The Romance language of Catalonia, an autonomous region in the northeast of Spain, also spoken in the Valencian autonomous region (where the language is officially named valencià), the Balearic Islands, Andorra, Roussillon in France, and the Sardinian city of Alghero.","The ability of a person to communicate in Catalan."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Catalan"}],"entries":[{"title":"Catalan language","blocks":[{"text":"Catalan is a Western Romance language that is native to the eastern Iberian Peninsula. It shares official status with Spanish in three autonomous communities in eastern Spain – Catalonia; the Balearic Islands; and the Valencian Community, where it is called Valencian – and is the sole official language of Andorra. Catalan also has semi-official status in Alghero, an Italian municipality in Sardinia, and is spoken in the Pyrénées-Orientales department of France and in two further areas in eastern Spain: the eastern strip of Aragon and the Carche area in the Region of Murcia. The Catalan-speaking regions are often called the Catalan Countries."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Catalan_language_in_Europe_%28cropped%29.png/330px-Catalan_language_in_Europe_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catalan_language","wikidata":"Q7026"},{"title":"Catalans","blocks":[{"text":"Catalans are a Romance-speaking ethnic group native to Catalonia, who speak Catalan. The current official category of \"Catalans\" is that of the citizens of Catalonia, a nationality and autonomous community in Spain and the inhabitants of the Roussillon historical region in Southern France, today the Pyrénées Orientales department, also called Northern Catalonia and Pays Catalan in French."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Map_of_the_Catalan_Diaspora_in_the_World.svg/330px-Map_of_the_Catalan_Diaspora_in_the_World.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catalans","wikidata":"Q244504"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Greuges_de_Guitard_Isarn.jpg/250px-Greuges_de_Guitard_Isarn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Greuges_de_Guitard_Isarn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Greuges_de_Guitard_Isarn.jpg/250px-Greuges_de_Guitard_Isarn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGreuges_de_Guitard_Isarn.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Homilies_d%27Organya.jpg/500px-Homilies_d%27Organya.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Homilies_d%27Organya.jpg/500px-Homilies_d%27Organya.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHomilies_d'Organya.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Interdiction_officielle_de_la_langue_catalana_2_avril_1700.jpg/500px-Interdiction_officielle_de_la_langue_catalana_2_avril_1700.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Interdiction_officielle_de_la_langue_catalana_2_avril_1700.jpg/500px-Interdiction_officielle_de_la_langue_catalana_2_avril_1700.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_ca